cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this package, please cite it as below."
title: "OversampleQA"
abstract: >-
  A diagnostic toolkit to validate, audit, and benchmark oversampling methods
  for imbalanced classification. OversampleQA hides part of the majority class
  and scores each synthetic minority sample by its nearest-neighbour distance to
  the hidden majority and to the real minority, yielding an error rate that
  measures how often an oversampler produces majority-like artifacts.
